  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "I like doing something",
     "texto": [
      "You already know **gern**: it goes after the verb to say you like doing something. **Ich lese gern** (I like reading), **Ich spiele gern Fußball** (I like playing soccer), **Ich höre gern Musik** (I like listening to music).",
      "To ask: **Was machst du in deiner Freizeit?** (What do you do in your free time?).",
      "Negation: **Ich gehe nicht gern ins Kino** (I don't like going to the movies)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "One verb for everything: spielen",
     "texto": [
      "**Spielen** is used for sports, games and instruments, and takes neither an article nor a preposition: **Fußball spielen**, **Tennis spielen**, **Gitarre spielen**.",
      "Two verbs that change their vowel: **lesen** (to read): **ich lese, du liest, er liest**; **sehen** (to see): **ich sehe, du siehst, er sieht**.",
      "**Zu Hause** = at home."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
